@1 = ~<CHARNAME>, Gradak's commander is standing right behind this palisade.~
@2 = ~A commander? And what else? These walls are impenetrable...~
@3 = ~We must vanquish him to access the passage discovered by the scouts.~
@4 = ~Did you find a way in?~
@5 = ~Yes, it's under a large rock on the south wall of the fortress.~
@6 = ~So, allons-y...~
@7 = ~We can't reach it while the battle is raging. The commander has to fall to give you time to sneak in.~
@8 = ~I've already slaughtered that damned General!~
@9 = ~The commander has to fall to give you time to sneak in.~
@10 = ~Then, allons-y !~
@11 = ~Here's the entry, good luck <CHARNAME>.~
